USVA_CASE_STUDY.md

# local agent context (kept out of public history)
CLAUDE.md

# impeccable tool state (live-mode config + generated design sidecar)
.impeccable/

# design-sync
.design-sync
.ds-sync/
ds-bundle/

brag-output

# press footage lives on the press-assets release, never in the tree
apps/docs/public/press/*.mp4
